PROGRAM OERCTL,8.0(21)
!!
!%W% %G% %U% - SCCS
!!
CIF NOTES AND NOT NOTES THEN
    USPS and Fedex labels are created and printed in this program when they
    get the tracking number.  UPS gets tracking number only, customer invoice
    program makes labels.

    On reprints the customer invoice program tries to lookup existing file
    and print it.
ENDCIF
\\MCODE'M2

COPY    "LINKER"                !!LINK MAPS AND MACROS
!!
